DATASET CURATION — why 20,634 files become 9,129 images
============================================================
Removed 8,035 images during collect_samples() deduplication:
  • 7,528 byte-identical copies (MD5) — same file repeated across leaf/data_1|2|3 and HF/UCI sources
  •   507 re-encoded duplicates (dHash) — same photo saved at different JPEG quality

Why removed: identical images in both train AND test inflate accuracy (~100% / ROC-AUC 1.0).
Dedup keeps each real leaf photo once; train/val/test split then stays leakage-free.

Classes kept (leaf/): healthy, bacterial blight, blast, brown spot
Classes dropped: tungro, leaf smut (no folders under leaf/ in this build)

